    "created_at": "2017-07-26T18:13:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-07-26T18:13:38Z",
    "body": "The processing model for preload is described in the preload specification: https://w3c.github.io/preload/\r\n\r\nBut the processing model for consoles is browser-specific, and isn't defined by any spec since it's not observable by web pages.",
